entries[85088] = { ["name"] = "Malevolent Gladiator's Copperskin Spaulders", ["text"] = "Season 12 Elite\nBinds when picked up\nShoulder Leather\n2086 Armor\n+1,208 Stamina\n+725 Intellect\n+457 Spirit\n+ 537 Mastery\n+ 322 PvP Power\n\nYellow Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 60 Intellect\n\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Monk\nRequires Level 90\n\nGladiator's Copperskin (0/5)\nGladiator's Copperskin Gloves\nGladiator's Copperskin Helm\nGladiator's Copperskin Legguards\nGladiator's Copperskin Tunic\nGladiator's Copperskin Spaulders\n(2) Set : Increases PvP power by 500.\n(2) Set : When your Renewing Mist is dispelled, you gain 1 charge of Mana Tea.\n(4) Set : When you use Thunder Focus Tea, you gain Zen Focus causing you to be immune to all silence and interrupt effects for 5 sec.\n(4) Set : Increases PvP Power by 1000.\nSell Price:" }
